  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unionlib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://tiny.one/unionlib\" alt=\"UnionLib\" width=\"177\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Minecraft-1.16.x-0967fc?labelColor=537DB5&amp;style=flat-square\" alt=\"Minecraft 版本\" width=\"133\" height=\"25\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/index_1.16.5.html\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/載入器-Forge-0967fc?labelColor=537DB5&amp;style=flat-square&amp;logo=curseforge\" alt=\"Forge\" width=\"131\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8MXShqa\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/648116022020145203?label=&amp;color=014980&amp;labelColor=537DB5&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=DDE4EF&amp;link=https://discord.gg/8MXShqa\" alt=\"Stereowalkers Discord\" width=\"121\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Stereowalker\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?label=&amp;color=014980&amp;labelColor=537DB5&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Patreon&amp;logoColor=DDE4EF&amp;url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api/?username=stereowalker&amp;type=patrons\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"116\" height=\"25\"></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>關於</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\">時間之痕是一個讓你的世界無需玩家介入即可自然老化的模組。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>特色</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>社交小徑（慾望路徑） -&nbsp;</strong>這會在你的世界中新增社交小徑（慾望路徑）。任何生物穿越草地時，經過一段時間後，地面會開始侵蝕。地面變化的順序為：草地 &gt; 泥土 &gt; 粗泥 &gt; 草徑。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>苔蘚生長 -&nbsp;</strong>隨著時間推移，某些有苔蘚變種的方塊會開始長出苔蘚。此效果可在設定檔中加快，或透過提高世界的隨機刻速度加速。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>流體侵蝕 -&nbsp;</strong>水和岩漿會對方塊產生特定影響。流動的水會隨著時間使某些具有裂紋變種的方塊開裂；而岩漿（無論是靜止還是流動）則會烘烤可以被烘烤的方塊。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>模組包使用</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\">您可以自由地將此模組加入您的模組包中，只要正確標註出處即可。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>鳴謝<br></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\">我要感謝我在 Patreon 上的所有贊助者。正是因為他們的支持，我才能持續活躍地製作這些模組，以下是他們的名單：</span><br><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>鑽石級</strong>&nbsp;👉 Mr_Jakob99、Kuechenbulle、Blue、Kudos</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FCcEewZ.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"316\"></p>",
